  "theoryOfChange": "Our primary goal is to help the international community achieve the UN's Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs):1. Help as many people as we can escape extreme poverty2. Help in the fight to end hunger and ensure access by all people to safe, nutritious and sufficient food all year round.3. Ensure as many people as possible have access to primary healthcare services4. Ensure as many girls and boys complete free quality primary and secondary education5. Give access to safe and affordable drinking water for as many people as possible6. Economically empower as many families as possible by providing them with the skills and resources they need to earn a sustainable income",
